
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Sana, Aşkım ❤️</title>
<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  color: white;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b1028, #a51d50, #f18ca9);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}
main { padding: 24px; max-width: 500px; }
h1 { font-size: 30px; }
#heart {
  font-size: 110px;
  border: none;
  background: transparent;
  cursor: pointer;
  animation: beat 1s infinite;
}
@keyframes beat {
  0%,100% { transform: scale(1); }
  50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
}
#letter {
  display: none;
  background: #fff0f3;
  color: #751b3b;
  padding: 25px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  line-height: 1.9;
  font-size: 19px;
  animation: appear 1s ease;
}
#letter.show { display: block; }
@keyframes appear {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(25px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
.floating {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: -30px;
  animation: float 5s linear forwards;
  pointer-events: none;
}
@keyframes float {
  to { transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(35deg); opacity: 0; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>Sana küçük bir sürprizim var, aşkım... 💕</h1>
  <p>Kalbime dokun ❤️</p>

  <button id="heart" aria-label="Mektubu aç">💗</button>

  <section id="letter">
    <p><b>İyi ki'lerimin en güzeli sensin aşkım. ❤️</b></p>
    <p>Seni ilk gördüğüm günkü gibi güzelsin hâlâ.</p>
    <p><b>Biz olduğumuz için çok mutluyum ve seni çok seviyorum. 💖</b></p>
    <p>Sonsuz sevgimle... 💌</p>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
function makeHeart() {
  const h = document.createElement("span");
  h.className = "floating";
  h.textContent = ["💗", "💕", "❤️", "💖"][Math.floor(Math.random()*4)];
  h.style.left = Math.random()*100 + "vw";
  h.style.fontSize = (18 + Math.random()*22) + "px";
  document.body.appendChild(h);
  setTimeout(() => h.remove(), 5000);
}
setInterval(makeHeart, 450);

document.getElementById("heart").addEventListener("click", function() {
  document.getElementById("letter").classList.add("show");
  this.textContent = "💖";
  this.style.animation = "none";
  for(let i=0; i<15; i++) setTimeout(makeHeart, i*100);
});
</script>
</body>
</html>